  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello,\nI know a feature I really enjoyed having, especially as somebody who helps run club events, is keeping an eye on the current instance population at a glance. \nI've seen some mods achieve this by placing the instance population (and maximum) in the area of the quick menu that displays your FPS and Ping when \"Pin FPS & Ping\" is enabled in settings.\nSo currently, the pin window shows:\n\"FPS: ### PING: ###\"\nI'm suggesting it then would show\n\"FPS: ### PING: ### WORLD: ##/## (##)\"\nWhere the WORLD potion is \"WORLD: current / max (hard cap)\"",
